nge alternate reality filled with demonic imagery and twisted monsters. She hears footsteps, disgusting, creepy monsters attack her, and she has to defend herself. Heather quickly comes to find that the events unfolding around her have something to do with her past. Exploring the eerie town of Silent Hill, she must find a way to escape.", "summary": "Silent Hill 3 is the third installment in the Silent Hill series. Like the previous entries, Silent Hill 3 is a survival horror combining action-based combat and puzzle-solving, but is somewhat more combat-oriented than the preceding installments. The main character is able to side-step and block some attacks, but in general shares with the other protagonists of the series their relative ineptitude in combat.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 18, "name": "Science fiction"}, {"id": 19, "name": "Horror"}, {"id": 21, "name": "Survival"}, {"id": 23, "name": "Stealth"}, {"id": 43, "name": "Mystery"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/silent-hill-3", "videos": [{"id": 36145, "name": "Gameplay Video", "video_id": "MLo2WtNN69Q", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MLo2WtNN69Q", "title": "Silent Hill 3 HD - Gameplay Walkthrough Part 1 - Prologue [4K 60FPS]", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/MLo2WtNN69Q/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 455, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "9s5t6R3aWwY", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9s5t6R3aWwY", "title": "Silent Hill 3 E3 2002 Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/9s5t6R3aWwY/hqdefault.jpg"}], "collections": [{"id": 63, "name": "Silent Hill"}], "characters": [{"id": 1640, "name": "Voice Actor"}, {"id": 16568, "name": "Douglas"}, {"id": 16567, "name": "Heather"}, {"id": 11585, "name": "Vincent"}, {"id": 5707, "name": "Claudia"}]}